      },
      {
        "id": "a3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000030",
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "Services",
        "level": 2,
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "a3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000032",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "The designer will provide the design services and deliverables described above with reasonable skill and care. The client will give the designer the content, feedback and approvals needed, in good time. The fees cover the rounds of revisions stated above. Further revisions and any other extra work must be agreed in writing, with the price, before that work starts.",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "a3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000033",
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "Fees and payment",
        "level": 2,
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "a3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000034",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "The client will pay the fees stated above. Any deposit stated above is payable before work starts. The designer will invoice the client, and each invoice is payable within the payment period stated above. The client will repay expenses only where it agreed them in writing beforehand. The fees include tax only as stated above. Payment is made as stated in how to pay, and a late payment is dealt with as stated above.",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "a3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000035",
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "Term and termination",
        "level": 2,
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "a3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000036",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "This agreement takes effect on the start date and continues for the term stated above. Either party may end it by giving the other written notice of at least the notice period stated above. Either party may end it at once, in writing, if the other seriously breaches it and does not put the breach right within the time to put a breach right stated above. When this agreement ends, the client will pay for the work done up to that date. The terms on payment, ownership of work and confidentiality continue after it ends.",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "a3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000037",
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "Ownership of work",
        "level": 2,
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "a3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000038",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "When the client has paid the fees in full, the designer transfers to the client the copyright and other intellectual property rights in the final approved designs. The designer keeps the rights in drafts, unused concepts and anything the designer made before or outside this agreement, and gives the client a permanent licence to use any of it that is part of the final approved designs. Fonts, stock images and other material from third parties stay subject to their own licences. The designer may show the finished work in a portfolio unless the client asks in writing to keep it private.",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "a3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000039",
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "Confidentiality",
        "level": 2,
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "a3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000040",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Each party will keep the other's confidential information private, use it only for this agreement, and not share it with anyone else without written permission. This does not apply to information that is already public or that the law requires a party to disclose. These duties continue after this agreement ends.",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "a3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000041",
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "Warranties",
        "level": 2,
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "a3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000042",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Each party confirms that it has the right to enter this agreement. The designer confirms that the work will be original or properly licensed. The client confirms that it has the right to use any content it gives the designer. Neither party makes any other promise about the work unless it is written in this agreement.",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "a3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000043",
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "Limitation of liability",
        "level": 2,
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "a3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000044",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Each party's total liability to the other under this agreement is limited to the limit of liability stated above. Neither party is liable for loss of profit or for indirect loss. Nothing in this agreement limits liability that the law does not allow to be limited.",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "a3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000108",
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "Disputes",
        "level": 2,
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "a3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000109",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "If a dispute arises under this agreement, the parties will first try to settle it by talking to each other in good faith. If that does not settle it, they will try mediation before going to court. Only the courts stated above may hear a dispute under this agreement.",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "a3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000045",
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "General terms",
        "level": 2,
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "a3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000046",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "The designer is an independent contractor and not an employee of the client. This agreement is the whole agreement between the parties about the services. Any change to it must be in writing and signed by both parties. Neither party may transfer it to someone else without the other's written consent. Notices under this agreement are given in writing to the addresses or emails stated above. This agreement is governed by the governing law stated above.",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "a3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000047",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "By signing below, each party agrees to the terms of this agreement.",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
